  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Step 7 of `PR-reviewer.md` now has a fixed light-lane row.\n- The row requires a result, the exact reviewed head, and evidence.\n- A review with no completed run keeps `Not run` and gives a reason.\n- The existing xtask policy tests pin the row and its instructions.\n- The decision record explains why no merge-time checker was added.\n\n## Why\n\nStep 5 already requires `cargo xtask gate light` after both review paths.\nStep 7 mentioned the result only in prose. The three reported reviews omitted it.\nThe fixed row makes an absent result visible. It does not change the gate policy.\nA red light run remains a note, not a blocker by itself.\n`Not run` remains distinct from a pass.\n\n## Readings\n\n- Issue #3846 and its complete comment thread.\n- Current `AGENTS.md`, the reviewer template, and the related xtask policy tests.\n- Commits `7ed8f307c` and `c2dd094e9`, which define the current light-lane rule.\n\n## Tests\n\nHead: `47e1aa31ead182dc9302aa9bf8df0ac4f293f8fb`.\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| New `heavy_plan_tests::review_report_always_has_a_light_lane_result_row` on the old template | FAIL as expected: the fixed table header is absent. |\n| The same test after the template change | PASS: 1 test. |\n| `cargo test -p xtask heavy_plan_tests:: -- --nocapture` | PASS: 12 tests. |\n| `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` | PASS: 1 executed xtask step, 0 failed, 0 stalled. Not a zero-step plan. |\n| `git diff --check` | PASS. |\n| `cargo fmt -p xtask -- --check` | FAIL: existing formatting differences across xtask. The unchanged base copy of `artifacts.rs` also fails formatting. The new test matches its formatted output. |\n| `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` | FAIL: `clippy::needless_bool` at unchanged `xtask/src/unit_sweep.rs:67`. That file is identical to the base. |\n| Light lane (`cargo xtask gate light`) | Not run. This contribution changes prose and a documentation test only. The review-time rule still requires this step; this is not a pass. |\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo release, light, heavy, application catalog, GUI, or full workspace build was run.\nNo runner workflow was started. No runtime code, dependency, workflow, or `PROCESS_VERSION` changed.\n\nEffort: low\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3846\n",
